/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 130 0 R
/T (   Ironic is a competitive robotics team from Manatee School for the Arts located in Palmetto, Florida. This team allows students 7-12th grade to learn through hands-on STEAM based programs as they work together to build a robot to compete in FIRST Tech Challenge throughout the school year. We have a total of 3 adult instructors and 7 hard-working team members who make whatever they imagine come to life.)
/E (   Ironic is a competitive robotics team from Manatee School for the Arts located in Palmetto, Florida. This team allows students 7-12th grade to learn through hands-on STEAM based programs as they work together to build a robot to compete in FIRST Tech Challenge throughout the school year. We have a total of 3 adult instructors and 7 hard-working team members who make whatever they imagine come to life.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
