/ActualText (    Students learn through hands-on teaching while working with mentors and student team managers. The student team captains typically take the lead in teaching and instructing the newer members on the ropes of their respective sub-teams \(i.e. engineering, coding, CAD, and driving\). If any additional help or input is needed, our mentors are always glad to answer any questions the students need. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
