/ActualText (    Besides plans on using our new space wisely, the team also has aims in upcoming fundraising. Each student has been given the opportunity to find five future donors. Whether it be a sponsor from a local business, or a contribution from friends and families, this search for more donors and sponsors helps us network within our community. Making connections is a huge part in gaining a better future for our team, and we are eager to get out into the community and gain from this opportunity.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
