/P 134 0 R
/ActualText (   One such event was the FIRST Lego League where Team Ironic brought their bot to one competition to allow the Lego League teams to drive the bot as well as see the scale of robotics they could compete in if they continued with FIRST programs.)
/Pg 12 0 R
