/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/ActualText ( Design 1 proved to be a great basis but needed it improvements in terms of sizing and structure. The axles in use with the first CAD design caused strain between the servo resulting in breaks. To combat this, originally extra bearings where used as spacers.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
