313 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/ActualText (At Meet #3 the drive team had almost perfected our placement method for pixels so rather than going for quantity we opted to try to create 2 mosaics utilizing pixels scored in autonomous, then we would attempt to stack pixels to get over the score lines by using mosaic nearest to the edge of the board for height. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
314 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/ActualText (  For our endgame portion, tweaks were made to the hanging system which improved consistently and speed. This, combined with our drone launcher making its debut, increased our projected endgame points from 20 points somewhat consistently to 20 - 50 points consistently, with our only issue in end game being occasional miss fires of our plane due to a small flaw in the endurance of our plane launcher. Finally, we started to swap out our batteries in between each match to maintain consistency.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [19]
>>
