/T (    In this season of FTC, our team took on some new members, a few of which were interested in the programming aspect of robotics. These new members were each first taught the basics of Java \(the language we use for our bot\). At first, our newer programmers were a bit confused by the code. However, after some time spent learning they were ready to work on programming specific functions for the bot this season. )
