/ActualText (on the controllers, those being the start buttons. The one on the the chassis controller resets the robot heading. The heading is the direction that the robot is facing. Our robot uses field-centric driving; which is dependent on the heading that we start with, so this button is to help us fix any issues from initialization.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
397 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 144 0 R
/ActualText (The button on the arm controller is to reset the arm offset. The arm position and arm encoder values depend on when the robot is initialized, so the arm will always have an offset. This button allows us to fix that issue resetting that offset so that the arm presets work correctly. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [8]
>>
